From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: Stereo 3D and Deep Colour page: install DisplayCAL from the page through Stereo APTus
 DisplayCAL stays off the image because it needs a measuring device. The page said
 "DisplayCAL is not installed" and offered nothing. Now it says what DisplayCAL
 requires (calibrator hardware), shows apt's sizes first and offers "Install DisplayCAL",
 which runs Stereo APTus' own entry action (pkexec, the problems engine, apt's sizes and
 failures said in the person's language). Nothing is installed until the button is pressed.
 The page does not detect a measuring device.
Origin: other, edition (ORDER 575)
Forwarded: no
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet via Claude Code

